SUMMARY:Disorder (2009)
DTSTART:20261122T030000Z
DTEND:20261122T041500Z
DTSTAMP:20261122T030000Z
UID:tlVkv698jN
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 58 mins (0h58m)\n\nPresented by Mount Analogue · A
 rt + Cinema. Huang Weikai’s groundbreaking documentary collects footage
  from a dozen amateur videographers and weaves them into a unique symphony
  of urban social dysfunction in China.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-t
 heaters/disorder-(现实是过去的未来)\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
